# Round 106: c_escape handled only quote, backslash and NEWLINE, so a
# CR in a string literal passed through RAW into the emitted C -- and
# gcc treats a lone CR as a line terminator, making the string literal
# unterminated: a build death with "missing terminating character" and
# no AOT: line (test_string_math.eigs, and anything carrying CRLF --
# HTTP, CSV, DOS text). TAB fixed in the same pass.
x is "a\r\nb"
print of (len of x)
y is "col1\tcol2"
print of (len of y)
print of (char_at of [x, 1])
